## Prerequisites

| Requirement | Verify with | Blocks |
|---|---|---|
| WAI-State.json exists | `test -f WAI-Spoke/WAI-State.json && echo PASS \|\| echo FAIL` | ceremony step |
| sessions/ directory writable | `test -d WAI-Spoke/sessions && echo PASS \|\| echo FAIL` | track write |

## Batch Sequence

**Batch:** automated-closeout-ceremony-v1
**Apply order:** 1 of 1
